/*
 * ThermalEdge AC – ESP32 Smart AC Controller
 *
 * Hardware:
 *   ESP32 DevKit V1
 *   DS18B20 → GPIO27
 *   IR LED  → GPIO4 (COOLIX)
 *
 * Library:
 *   PsychicHttp 3.1.0
 *
 * URL:
 *   http://smartac.local
 */

